INFO  merge request created {"url": ".../pull/128"}
INFO  update finished</code></pre> <p>Project status: pre-1.0 (<code>v0.x</code>)</p> <p>Drupdater is in active development and used in real pipelines, but the CLI surface and config format may still change between minor versions. Pin to a specific image tag in production.</p>

GitHub ActionsGitLab CILocal docker run <p>Add a repository secret named <code>DRUPALCODE_ACCESS_TOKEN</code>, then:</p> <pre><code>  - run: /opt/drupdater/bin
    env:
      DRUPDATER_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.DRUPDATER_TOKEN }}
      DRUPALCODE_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.DRUPALCODE_ACCESS_TOKEN }}
</code></pre> <p>Add a masked, protected CI/CD variable named <code>DRUPALCODE_ACCESS_TOKEN</code>. It is then already in the job environment, and nothing further is needed.</p> <pre><code>docker run -e DRUPALCODE_ACCESS_TOKEN \
  ghcr.io/drupdater/drupdater-php8.3:latest \
  &lt;token&gt; --clone --repository-url &lt;repository-url&gt;
</code></pre> <p>The token is registered with the log redactor as soon as it is read, so it never appears in log output or in the run report.</p>
